	"data": "Goal: Skill Tree Integration\n\nRPG-style progression auto-generated from the thought graph. XP, levels, prerequisites, mastery.\n\nWhat This Is\nSkill trees as a special type of thought bubble with progression mechanics. Not a separate system — an overlay on the existing spatial graph. Skill nodes are bubbles with prerequisite/mastery relationships (typed links).\n\nSpecific Behaviors Needed\nSkill node type — a bubble variant with XP, level, prerequisite, and mastery fields\nPrerequisite links — typed…",
